Distribution and model boundary
-------------------------------
This repository's own code is the thin official application host plus product
identity, capability expectations and release wiring. It also bundles the model
weights used by the official distribution.

The current bundle includes YOLO26 model weights that this distribution treats
as AGPL-3.0-covered under the documented upstream licensing position. Under the
current bundled-model choices, the distributed application is therefore
released under AGPL-3.0. Distribution carries AGPL-3.0 obligations, including
complete corresponding source for the exact build; that source includes the
exact Sailens Android commit pinned at sailens/.

Model files carry their own upstream and training-dataset terms independently
of the platform code licence. The bundled semantic segmentation model is trained
on Cityscapes, which is restricted to NON-COMMERCIAL use. See
docs/model-provenance.md for the complete current records.

Sailens is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Ultralytics.
"YOLO" is used only descriptively in model provenance.

